\item[S2] Michel Waldschmidt, \emph{Open Diophantine Problems}, arXiv:math/0312440v2 (2004), Section 3.1, Conjecture 3.7 (Four Exponentials Conjecture). \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0312440}.
